sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    actor U as Usuario
    participant CLI as CLI / GUI
    participant DISC as Agente descubrimiento
    participant PROV as LLMProvider
    participant LLM as API de LLM
    participant FS as Repo clonado
    participant PIPE as Pipeline

    U->>CLI: URL del repositorio
    CLI->>DISC: discover_from_url(url)
    DISC->>FS: git clone (caché)
    DISC->>FS: construye árbol filtrado

    loop hasta done o agotar presupuesto
        DISC->>PROV: chat(messages, tools)
        PROV->>LLM: HTTPS
        LLM-->>PROV: tool_calls
        PROV-->>DISC: respuesta
        DISC->>FS: dispatch(call): list_dir / read_file / grep / select_evidence
        FS-->>DISC: resultado
    end

    DISC-->>CLI: evidencia (evidence/)
    CLI->>PIPE: run_pipeline(evidence)

    PIPE->>PROV: generate (análisis)
    PROV-->>PIPE: 02_analysis.md
    PIPE->>PROV: generate (diseño)
    PROV-->>PIPE: 03_design.md
    PIPE->>PROV: generate (DDL)
    PROV-->>PIPE: 04_ddl.sql
    PIPE-->>CLI: DDL final
